{"answer": {"contains": ["11:50"], "fold": true}, "budget": {"requests": 75, "steps": 30, "wall_s": 600}, "category": "i18n", "difficulty": 2, "family": "i18n-zh-chat", "files": {"hidden": {}, "solution": {}, "start": {".gitkeep": ""}}, "gold_answer": "Total 11:50", "id": "i18n-zh-chat-04-timesheet-notes", "kind": "lookup", "lang": "text", "mode": "answer", "notes": {"prompt_lang": "zh", "source": "chat-timesheet-sum-02-dot-d2", "source_category": "chat", "source_family": "chat-timesheet-sum", "source_sha": "2d9c40feb17cfe7c", "style": "chatty"}, "pass": "", "prompt": "我习惯把工时随手记在手机备忘录里，现在要算本周的总工时好开发票。对了，打印机又卡纸了，不过那是另一回事。\n\n```\n周二: 8.15-13.05, 13.40-16.40\n周六: 9.45-13.45\n```\n\n总共工作了多长时间？请写成 H:MM（例如 31:05）。\n", "protected": [], "schema": "sleipnir-training/1", "setup": [], "sha": "dcf1386b643f2eb8", "tags": ["answer", "d2", "derived", "i18n", "lookup", "prompt-zh", "src-chat", "text"], "team": {"mode": "single"}, "timeout_s": 120, "verify": ""}
{"answer": {"contains": ["9", "7", "4328.6"], "fold": true}, "budget": {"requests": 75, "steps": 30, "wall_s": 600}, "category": "i18n", "difficulty": 2, "family": "i18n-zh-chat", "files": {"hidden": {}, "solution": {}, "start": {".gitkeep": ""}}, "gold_answer": "9, 7, 4328.6", "id": "i18n-zh-chat-05-sql-null-trap", "kind": "lookup", "lang": "text", "mode": "answer", "notes": {"prompt_lang": "zh", "source": "chat-sql-reading-01-count_null", "source_category": "chat", "source_family": "chat-sql-reading", "source_sha": "ccd18825af3a366c", "style": "quiz"}, "pass": "", "prompt": "新同事出了一道 SQL 题，我觉得是个陷阱题。（按 SQLite 的语义）\n\n```\nstaff\nid | name     | dept    | salary\n-- | -------- | ------- | ------\n1  | Rosalind | sales   | 4800\n2  | Jamila   | sales   | 6300\n3  | Wren     | sales   | 6200\n4  | Wendell  | design  | 3400\n5  | Oskar    | infra   | 3200\n6  | Idris    | sales   | 3000\n7  | Tobias   | infra   | NULL\n8  | Vera     | support | NULL\n9  | Yuki     | support | 3400\n\nQuery:\nSELECT COUNT(*), COUNT(salary), AVG(salary) FROM staff\n```\n\n这条查询会返回什么？按顺序给我三个数字（平均值保留一位小数）。\n（请直接写数字，不要千分位分隔符。）\n", "protected": [], "schema": "sleipnir-training/1", "setup": [], "sha": "9854974b4b8e1eaa", "tags": ["answer", "d2", "derived", "i18n", "lookup", "prompt-zh", "src-chat", "text"], "team": {"mode": "single"}, "timeout_s": 120, "verify": ""}
{"answer": {"contains": ["5", "7"], "fold": false}, "budget": {"requests": 75, "steps": 30, "wall_s": 600}, "category": "i18n", "difficulty": 2, "family": "i18n-zh-chat", "files": {"hidden": {}, "solution": {}, "start": {".gitkeep": ""}}, "gold_answer": "5 matches; last is line 7", "id": "i18n-zh-chat-06-regex-vol", "kind": "lookup", "lang": "text", "mode": "answer", "notes": {"prompt_lang": "zh", "source": "chat-regex-match-01-count", "source_category": "chat", "source_family": "chat-regex-match", "source_sha": "6d9ba872f790462b", "style": "terse"}, "pass": "", "prompt": "写日志脱敏脚本，想先手算一下正则对不对（Python 3.11 的 Pattern，区分大小写）：`\\bvol[0-9]\\b`\n\n```\n1: \"error: mem 97% on vol3\"\n2: \"warn: disk 91% on vol3\"\n3: \"warn: cpu 88% on node7\"\n4: \"error: disk 100% on vol12\"\n5: \"info: disk 7% on vol9\"\n6: \"ERROR: disk 99% on vol2\"\n7: \"warn: disk 9% on vol4\"\n```\n\n`re.search` 会在上面带编号的行里命中多少行？最后一个命中的行号是多少？每行内容就是引号之间的文本（如果某行末尾有空格，也算内容的一部分）。\n", "protected": [], "schema": "sleipnir-training/1", "setup": [], "sha": "5c59e9c03ba1672d", "tags": ["answer", "d2", "derived", "i18n", "lookup", "prompt-zh", "src-chat", "text"], "team": {"mode": "single"}, "timeout_s": 120, "verify": ""}
{"answer": {"contains": ["382.97"], "fold": true}, "budget": {"requests": 112, "steps": 45, "wall_s": 900}, "category": "i18n", "difficulty": 3, "family": "i18n-zh-chat", "files": {"hidden": {}, "solution": {}, "start": {".gitkeep": ""}}, "gold_answer": "382.97 CHF (from 393.20 CAD left).", "id": "i18n-zh-chat-07-fx-round-trip", "kind": "lookup", "lang": "text", "mode": "answer", "notes": {"prompt_lang": "zh", "source": "chat-currency-trip-03-chfcad-d3", "source_category": "chat", "source_family": "chat-currency-trip", "source_sha": "1603996140af339e", "style": "long"}, "pass": "", "prompt": "你好，容我啰嗦几句：假期回来后我想算算来回换汇到底亏了多少。出发前我把 800.00 CHF 换成了 CAD。我姐说我想多了，大概确实如此。\n\n去程：1 CHF 兑 0.9852 CAD，固定手续费 3.00 CHF（先从 CHF 里扣掉），结果向下取整到分。我在那边花了 392.00 CAD，剩下的按 1 CAD 兑 0.9740 CHF 换了回来，回程不收手续费，同样向下取整到分。\n\n请问我最后手里有多少 CHF？\n", "protected": [], "schema": "sleipnir-training/1", "setup": [], "sha": "250bf451d914728f", "tags": ["answer", "d3", "derived", "i18n", "lookup", "prompt-zh", "src-chat", "text"], "team": {"mode": "single"}, "timeout_s": 120, "verify": ""}
