{"answer": {"contains": ["18:46:00", "13"], "fold": true}, "budget": {"requests": 250, "steps": 100, "wall_s": 2400}, "category": "i18n", "difficulty": 5, "family": "i18n-zh-chat", "files": {"hidden": {}, "solution": {}, "start": {".gitkeep": ""}}, "gold_answer": "The first failure was at 18:46:00 UTC, 13 minutes BEFORE the deploy started at 18:59:00, so the deploy can't be the cause.", "id": "i18n-zh-chat-09-incident-timeline", "kind": "premise", "lang": "text", "mode": "answer", "notes": {"prompt_lang": "zh", "source": "chat-premise-timeline-04-240-3", "source_category": "chat", "source_family": "chat-premise-timeline", "source_sha": "442ab98657adcec6", "style": "long"}, "pass": "", "prompt": "事后复盘。日志 A 来自搜索前端，时间是 UTC；日志 B 来自索引器，时间戳是本地时间（UTC+4），而且已知它的时钟快了 3 分钟。经理的说法是这次故障是发布引起的，理由是日志 B 里的第一次失败出现在日志 A 里的发布之后。\n\n```\nLog A (UTC)\n18:29:00  INFO  search frontend healthy\n18:49:00  WARN  alert fired: error rate above threshold\n18:59:00  INFO  deploy v2.35 started\n19:01:00  INFO  deploy finished\n\nLog B (local)\n22:40:00  INFO  indexer idle\n22:49:00  ERROR first failed job: connection refused\n23:01:00  ERROR 5 jobs failing\n```\n\n统一换算到同一条 UTC 时间线上：日志 B 里的第一次失败发生在发布开始之前还是之后，相差多少分钟（给出分钟数）？这次首次失败的 UTC 时间是几点（HH:MM:SS）？\n", "protected": [], "schema": "sleipnir-training/1", "setup": [], "sha": "0b5b1a50894aeb6a", "tags": ["answer", "d5", "derived", "i18n", "premise", "prompt-zh", "src-chat", "text"], "team": {"mode": "single"}, "timeout_s": 120, "verify": ""}
